  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and bell pepper and cook until they are softened.",
    "Add the corn kernels, sake, chili powder, and salt to the skillet and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Warm the taco shells according to the package instructions.",
    "Fill the taco shells with the corn and vegetable mixture.",
    "Top the tacos with shredded cheese and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with diced tomatoes or shredded lettuce if desired.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
